n\">execute</span>(initRdbAsync);</span></div>\n        <div class=\"de-code-line de-diff-line--add\"><span class=\"de-code-gutter\">14</span><span class=\"de-code-content\">  Logger.<span class=\"fn\">info</span>(<span class=\"str\">'Cold start -138ms'</span>);</span></div>\n        <div class=\"de-code-line\"><span class=\"de-code-gutter\">15</span><span class=\"de-code-content\">}</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <footer class=\"de-statusbar\">\n    <span>1 处变更 · EntryAbility.ets</span>\n    <span>UTF-8 · LF</span>\n  </footer>\n</section>"
